  "sourceTitle": "Ice Cream Smoothie Cocktail",
  "sourceText": "Ice Cream Smoothie Cocktail\nBy: Desiree Mellon\nPublished: Tuesday, December 1, 2009 - 12:13am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 cups Chocolate Chip Ice Cream\n3 tablespoons Kahlua\n3 tablespoons Rum\n3 tablespoons Brandy\n1 Banana\nIce\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Peel and chop banana. 2 Place all ingredients in a blender. 3 Liquefy on high speed till creamy and smooth. 4 Serve chilled\n\nAbout\n\n\nSmooth, creamy, fruity cocktail. A treat for the taste buds.",
  "parsedSource": {
    "ingredients": [
      {
        "sourceText": "2 cups Chocolate Chip Ice Cream"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "3 tablespoons Kahlua"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "3 tablespoons Rum"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "3 tablespoons Brandy"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "1 Banana"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "Ice"
      }
    ],
    "steps": [
      {
        "text": "1 Peel and chop banana. 2 Place all ingredients in a blender. 3 Liquefy on high speed till creamy and smooth. 4 Serve chilled"
